1
00:00:00,353 --> 00:00:03,563
(Penny:)-Who's Adam West?
-Who's Adam West?

2
00:00:04,191 --> 00:00:06,691
(Sheldon:)What do the two of you
talk about after the coitus?

3
00:00:08,695 --> 00:00:11,905
(Howard:)My guess is,
"Hey, four minutes. New record."

4
00:00:13,492 --> 00:00:14,532
[HOWARD CHUCKLES]

5
00:00:14,701 --> 00:00:16,911
(Howard:)That's why I'm the funny one.

6
00:00:17,412 --> 00:00:19,702
(Leonard:)Anyway, we followed the guy
to this garage sale.

7
00:00:19,873 --> 00:00:21,203
(Leonard:)They had the coolest stuff.

8
00:00:21,374 --> 00:00:24,294
(Howard:)They were closing up.
We got this whole box for 60 bucks.

9
00:00:24,461 --> 00:00:26,881
We didn't go through it.
There could be anything.

10
00:00:27,047 --> 00:00:29,587
(Penny:)There a new girlfriend in there?
You might need one.

11
00:00:30,383 --> 00:00:34,593
(Leonard:)No, but there is an original final draft
Ghostbusters script...

12
00:00:34,763 --> 00:00:36,433
(Leonard:)...with actual slime stains.

13
00:00:37,224 --> 00:00:38,394
[WHISPERS INDISTINCTLY]

14
00:00:38,558 --> 00:00:41,558
Oh, you're right, it's Ghostbusters ll.
Never mind.

15
00:00:43,730 --> 00:00:45,980
(Howard:)Oh, my God.

16
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:50,070
(Howard:)An ALF doll.

17
00:00:51,613 --> 00:00:56,073
(Howard:)When I was 11, my mother got me one
to help me sleep after my dad left.

18
00:00:56,243 --> 00:01:00,743
(Howard:)I used to pretend that my dad
had moved to the planet Melmac...

19
00:01:00,914 --> 00:01:04,584
...and ALF was gonna bring him back
to me.

20
00:01:05,127 --> 00:01:06,587
(Howard:)But he never did.

21
00:01:08,255 --> 00:01:10,755
[IN STRAINED VOICE]
Where's my daddy, puppet?

22
00:01:13,635 --> 00:01:15,635
(Howard:)Where is he?

23
00:01:17,097 --> 00:01:19,097
(Penny:)That is so sad.

24
00:01:19,266 --> 00:01:24,026
(Sheldon:)No, what's sad is that you don't know
that Adam West was TV's Batman.

